  "result": "The fixes for all nine reports are in; the existing suite passes (617 tests), and a throwaway scenario test covering the reports passed before I deleted it.\n\nThree things you might not expect from the diff:\n\n- **Data repair on migrate:** `runMigrations` now also sets every live membership with status `invited` to `active`. Those rows are the people from report 2, who would otherwise stay locked out and could not be re-invited. Orgs that over-accepted will then show their true seat count, which may be over plan.\n- **Sessions after removal or deletion:** the session's default workspace is cleared to none rather than switched to another workspace the person belongs to. Say if you want it to fall back to one instead.\n- **Already-a-member accept:** if a current member accepts a leftover invitation, it is used up and their existing membership is returned unchanged (no role change, no join event).",
